          "id": "b207a9af-ff63-4102-8368-7369bf2c2893",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>impaciente</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>impaciente</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/30c8ffbc7ff44f42aa7f0a2a9725a6ee_b08-impaciente.png?Expires=1794099565&Signature=ucJJXiAF~Vn0JhDkCk-LK~w2oWJHa5XeRiujZwSp1ULjeE-KJjEKYKXHBBcHNw3LihY10fwf4WusCjpOm7z9sG191wbWWxLiQ-~Ht2-ayE9aGy8yIccn9bs9mh6Dag-Fj2LI1RWoNGcdI7FeFW4F8GQ60GxH5ZbP6YaIr9KbFQRtKteSULVRkGzZqXXYd~6LcqwPFIenngQZO8vks7CeAf8CnIIQLN4x2k7H-1-KUDZuNB-BGiHF-ubDBMPgokgtkc1yXTf5vexqysAFxYart4ufT7~REPdqChaV4ZnP-LjKs6POmuMzFwlSnwzs0V745FeKhjRC7fnVGuJ9d6Z3mQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
