    {
      "id": "99f268d1-4d10-4e75-96c8-4735c991761e",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe o contraste mais útil para este último traço da aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6caf964d-d566-4e34-843d-5473a0cd7a4f",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>impaciente</strong> aparece quando a pessoa não lida bem com espera, atraso ou processo lento.</p><p>O contraste útil aqui é <strong>paciente / impaciente</strong>.</p><p><strong>Con las filas largas es muy impaciente.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Com filas longas, ela é muito impaciente.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "91b141d5-6570-48fe-8c7d-74c5d78b6084",
      "title": "Comentando um conhecido novo",
      "description": "<p>Duas pessoas comentam um conhecido depois de um primeiro contato rápido.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 10,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Qué te pareció Caio?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">O que você achou do Caio?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/526c042c109f4d5bb3c547c3dc449dd3_b10-01-que-te-parecio-caio.mp3?Expires=1794099565&Signature=qHEpuIHkLFBBmoCTUY96v6GQwxdcQMDQIgh5-NYExbNYLzyiiSBj0PuW9RX8MLV29MDASUo3xMbhveAnbplP~BaXTa1bgjxgMz8Hdj4mwqd-fi6hJ8wjfhwwki5B6GKg3yxSIHQS0HnZaUEivG7ZgGV3HLzTzx3dOwCl6cfHaM-bkHktCMR35SkhK2ot6Y~THSRfB2ciSkHFWD6VL5IvGzKIzSl~0v6gPhDDqB13-U8mYOBIGisGU3gyZUiX7f1D62rUbH~SPprfp3fPIdygX97OxWjA2HFxqqJD1i23v6-R6mEercdOjtZoDN9mQrj9kWGdB7EIIjzbGK12V-rSpA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Al principio parece sincero, pero a veces es un poco mentiroso.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">No começo, ele parece sincero, mas às vezes é um pouco mentiroso.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b05b5b79b8fd420d9bdaa113b8d97f30_b10-02-al-principio-parece-sincero-pero-a-veces-es-un-poco-mentiroso.mp3?Expires=1794099565&Signature=kHiJDG4hDQvHMVp~RGU4BpDEsmpQthn8zp~hmJj-at8OLlPy2g6COIVkLiAh3zr-q2HHyZ5WuVmI6VHqtDKf7y80Nk1zfqfW~ItqniZDcgpY4ehP7APXnB2ZLAeC4tr7JhR5xWvp7X1kl-fqpevY~HiUmCzusAkLMPZD~FDrITMtjNXQl54g2Wpn8Ght78T-0Mt5DpPISfVGJEkdslF88ysm6qcEf4VQkM6ikWzgU8ZT15mHDzU~1~T2-88xSTyDdtPYjpo-37qm6N5PbIVnZ52gwuxmi98N31aEc88lV~fN5d2bGrsikq7tQXxgnGmZntgVomy3mpNM7i0IPSG~ZQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, y además es bastante cerrado con la gente nueva.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, e além disso ele é bastante fechado com gente nova.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5302924cd3434bb4a93d87eecaab34f1_b10-03-si-y-ademas-es-bastante-cerrado-con-la-gente-nueva.mp3?Expires=1794099565&Signature=0pBFyh531-sk3UrnPxbO42o2pND672BiQmfSy7dW6EZIqQLCh647C8rDsZqkhhAJINd7BSn8k8vIuaqB483k1YN6twhfhmdvCepvgrGfjiTJI5lACqMPK2O2Y5EqzcK9Ds1zcldohvif8bL0Bk2UnNEZdAmTCHDue5WAf2NvNF5I2LabLHh6ywdw8dv1Cw8xgnFf1C9JqFyMyGw5ny0ZTLxjfzs6GbCWRPjjntHT5F2wx~ZOBHwr6UUF~Wbe68azYbAehuo8OFCUwOhov8eUwd0QFrQOGpOvsbIP43wdFMZI~-JznXyplESk7Uzgwt4ZT4ocq0CXbPuQJ-UJ2eeTfg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Y cuando hay problemas, es muy pesimista e impaciente.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">E quando há problemas, ele é muito pessimista e impaciente.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d2b625cdc61c4d7ca1a6c01a71dd7d79_b10-04-y-cuando-hay-problemas-es-muy-pesimista-e-impaciente.mp3?Expires=1794099565&Signature=BE5NAyQmt8q5YFP85HfS9H5b2GSBxKilSFbt22KurQR54-dYBexzaEOMMEZd~dPc2riK1IKSKh6AhPIRSXkE13hdJNEeEn1mXtmpNS~LPicXngASQGzQlGzjRi7yh~6whaADp58bT6JN7MQjQMw59fVEqSQ2JihjDRqORiTiCsI4G-UhhPO1hhJJeDBgF6q4VDctOT0JOT3Roy9Q~wLRYgRs44OVh8lpo0qvu0tbB4KyVDdxJBaqqrXOcnzFCkE9AeS07UP9JVG~OGTMSbIQYPJHVlMunEfueb2Vems6n0X4CWjh2qng2DJFm0taL9ZIevsQKxG0sLrnXfuLBoWTuQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
